  "mma": {
    "label": "MMA",
    "notes": "No formal rank/belt system for MMA itself (practitioners' individual base-discipline belts, e.g. BJJ, are tracked separately under that discipline). 'no_rank' is valid and expected here. Amateur/Pro status is a competition classification, not a rank - don't conflate the two.",
    "ranks": [
